  "margin_definition": "median over d_out rows of |A_i[r]| * ||B_i||_2 / (||Q(Wbase)[r,:]-Wbase[r,:]||_2 + eps); Q = the rung's quantizer applied to Wbase once (shared across edits in the bank)",
